# Marshal — the Fly.io-backed deployments runtime. All config is env vars; there is no
# database (the only state is the S3-compatible bucket below).

# Server
MARSHAL_PORT=# port to listen on. Defaults to ${NEXT_PUBLIC_HEXCLAVE_PORT_PREFIX:-81}47
MARSHAL_API_KEY=# bearer credential the backend must present on every /v1 request. Required: Marshal refuses to start if unset
MARSHAL_WEBHOOK_SECRET=# HMAC key for per-build webhook tokens. Defaults to MARSHAL_API_KEY (fine outside prod)
MARSHAL_PUBLIC_URL=# base URL builder machines use to call the completion webhook (e.g. https://marshal.example.com). Required for real Fly builds; unused by the mock builder
MARSHAL_ENV_ID=# environment discriminator baked into Fly app names ("dev", "stg", "prd"). App names are global across ALL of Fly, so this must differ per environment
MARSHAL_ALLOW_MOCKS=# set to 1 only in development/test environments to permit the mock Fly token or mock builder; mocks fail closed when unset

# Fly.io
MARSHAL_FLY_API_TOKEN=# org-scoped Fly token ("FlyV1 fm2_..."). The sentinel value mock_hexclave_fly_key points Marshal at the fly-mock docker service instead (non-prod only)
MARSHAL_FLY_ORG_SLUG=# Fly org slug all tenant apps live in (one org per environment)
MARSHAL_FLY_MACHINES_API_URL=# override for the Machines REST API. Defaults to https://api.machines.dev (or the fly-mock when the mock token is set)
MARSHAL_FLY_GRAPHQL_API_URL=# override for the GraphQL API (certs/IPs). Defaults to https://api.fly.io/graphql (or the fly-mock)
MARSHAL_FLY_LOGS_API_URL=# override for the logs API. Defaults to https://api.fly.io/api/v1 (or the fly-mock)
MARSHAL_FLY_REGISTRY_HOST=# override for the Docker registry. Defaults to registry.fly.io
MARSHAL_FLY_REGION=# Fly region machines are created in (runtime policy, not part of the service spec). Defaults to iad
MARSHAL_BUILDER=# "fly" (ephemeral BuildKit machine, the default) or "mock" (instant fake digest — for dev/e2e; non-prod only)

# Bucket (S3-compatible; Cloudflare R2 in production, the s3mock container locally)
MARSHAL_S3_ENDPOINT=# S3 API endpoint URL. Required
MARSHAL_S3_REGION=# S3 region ("auto" for R2). Defaults to auto
MARSHAL_S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=# Required
MARSHAL_S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=# Required
MARSHAL_S3_BUCKET=# bucket holding specs/, uploads/, builds/, domains/. Required
MARSHAL_S3_FORCE_PATH_STYLE=# set to 1 for path-style addressing (required for the s3mock container)
